  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WAPP Ghana-Cote d&apos;Ivoire Interconnection Project - Phase 1 WA-REMP MPA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective is to: (i) increase electricity trade between Ghana and Cote d&apos;Ivoire; and (ii) to make the WAPP Information and Coordination Center fully operational.</narrative>
  </description>
